Falsifies `non_volatile_memory_express_contract::verification::an_accepted_handoff_keeps_its_doorbells_inside_the_mapped_page`.

The defect: `Handoff::unpack` stops refusing a stride above `MAX_DSTRD`. A stride the spec permits
and QEMU never reports then computes a doorbell offset outside the one page of BAR0 the EL0 data
plane is mapped, the case the constant exists to prevent.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!((0x1000..0x2000).contains(&off))`.

